<title>INDIA: India's Arvind completes 600 mln private placement.</title>
<headline>India's Arvind completes 600 mln private placement.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian denim maker, Arvind Mills said on Monday its private placement for 600 million rupees of a total debenture issue of one billion rupees had been fully subscribed.</p>
<p>ICICI Securities &amp; Finance Company and Kotak Mahindra Capital Company were appointed the lead managers to the issue.</p>
<p>Arvind Mills said the public portion for the balance 400 million rupee issue was &quot;encouraging.&quot; The public issue closes on October 10, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
